    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEXO is a side-view, 2-player cooperative shooting game where you must defeat a powerful boss within a limited time! Team up with a friend to take down mighty enemies! Each character wields a weapon with both a normal attack and a special attack, and these two types of attacks can interact with each other. Work together to unleash even more powerful combined attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your character based on their unique traits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the sisters, Ria and Nia, uses a weapon with distinct characteristics. Select the character that best matches your play style! When two players team up and attack in sync, they can unleash even more powerful attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/0e5f6dba1f01f98ef01fae73908d24fa.avif?t=1747235427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the boss\u2019s invasion of Earth!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien lifeform has appeared on Earth!! The boss will use a variety of attacks to threaten the players. Use nearby platforms and shields to evade the boss\u2019s attacks as much as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/2ccaf51266e7e54ea1e8e09d9d814e98.avif?t=1747235427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Counter the boss\u2019s powerful attacks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At specific moments, the boss will unleash terrifying attacks! Cooperate to counter these powerful moves and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/294048bf61a3831b11002b10b0179b7b.avif?t=1747235427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEXO is a side-view, 2-player cooperative shooting game where you must defeat a powerful boss within a limited time! Team up with a friend to take down mighty enemies! Each character wields a weapon with both a normal attack and a special attack, and these two types of attacks can interact with each other. Work together to unleash even more powerful combined attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your character based on their unique traits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the sisters, Ria and Nia, uses a weapon with distinct characteristics. Select the character that best matches your play style! When two players team up and attack in sync, they can unleash even more powerful attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/0e5f6dba1f01f98ef01fae73908d24fa.avif?t=1747235427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the boss\u2019s invasion of Earth!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien lifeform has appeared on Earth!! The boss will use a variety of attacks to threaten the players. Use nearby platforms and shields to evade the boss\u2019s attacks as much as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/2ccaf51266e7e54ea1e8e09d9d814e98.avif?t=1747235427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Counter the boss\u2019s powerful attacks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At specific moments, the boss will unleash terrifying attacks! Cooperate to counter these powerful moves and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426770/extras/294048bf61a3831b11002b10b0179b7b.avif?t=1747235427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
